        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Baseball Stars Professional is the follow-up to Baseball Stars for the Nintendo Entertainment System, and features comic-style graphics. Choose from a variety of teams that include Celestial Planets, Heavenly Bodies, Shadow Demons, Battle Knights, Fabulous Superstars, and many others. Then select the field where the game is to be held: The SNK stadium or the SNK dome. Each field has the same dimensions, but their capacity varies. The game is played the same way as normal baseball. Features a VS. mode in which two players can play against each other.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Baseball Stars Professional es la secuela de Baseball Stars para Nintendo Entertainment System y presenta gráficos al estilo cómic. Elige entre una variedad de equipos que incluyen Celestial Planets, Heavenly Bodies, Shadow Demons, Battle Knights, Fabulous Superstars y muchos otros. Después, selecciona el campo donde se jugará: el estadio SNK o el domo SNK. Cada campo tiene las mismas dimensiones, pero su capacidad varía. El juego se desarrolla igual que el béisbol normal. Incluye un modo VS. en el que dos jugadores pueden enfrentarse.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "1990",
          "source": "igdb",
