        },
        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Baseball Stars 2 is the sequel to the very successful Baseball Stars game released for Nintendo in the late 1980s. It was released by SNK for Arcade, as well as the Nintendo Entertainment System. Players can create leagues of up to 125 games (6 teams playing each other 25 times) and view statistics such as League Standings, Average, Home Runs, Runs Batted In, Earned Run Average, Wins and Saves. Players can fire players and upgrade them using the same 15-point system introduced in the original Baseball Stars.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Baseball Stars 2 es la secuela del exitoso Baseball Stars, lanzado para Nintendo a finales de los años 80. SNK lo publicó para arcade y para Nintendo Entertainment System. Los jugadores pueden crear ligas de hasta 125 partidos (6 equipos que se enfrentan entre sí 25 veces) y consultar estadísticas como la clasificación de la liga, promedio de bateo, jonrones, carreras impulsadas, efectividad de lanzador, victorias y salvamentos. Se puede despedir a jugadores y mejorarlos con el mismo sistema de 15 puntos introducido en el Baseball Stars original.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "1992",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
      ],
